Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.89-rt97 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.89 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: a0cd91b9603efb94f9ece3ace370526675d39618


Or to build 3.10.89-rt97 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.89.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.89-rt97.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
